                <invention-title lang="de">VERBESSERTES SYSTEM UND VERFAHREN ZUM HARZTRANSFERFORMEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME ET PROCÉDÉ AMÉLIORÉS POUR MOULAGE PAR TRANSFERT DE RÉSINE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">IMPROVED SYSTEM AND METHOD FOR RESIN TRANSFER MOULDING</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Apparatuses, devices, systems 1 and methods for resin transfer moulding of composite articles are disclosed. A mould enclosure 8,10 and a manifold 4 are provided. The manifold 5 comprises a plurality of valves 44a-44e. A body of the manifold 4 defines a resin inlet 41, a plurality of resin outlets 45a-45e and an internal resin chamber therebetween. Each valve 44a-44e is arranged to control flow between the internal resin chamber and a corresponding one of the outlets 45a-45e.</p>
            </abstract>
